        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.18.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nwo 18.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaka pa Levi keken aye Moses pe omiyo botgi lobo mo me aleya; gityer ma giwaŋo ki mac bot Rwot Lubaŋa pa Icrael aye gubedo ma ka ginaleyagi, kit ma Rwot yam owaco bote-ni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses yam omiyo ginaleya bot kaka pa jo pa Reuben muporo dogolagi ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pienno waŋ lobogi ocakke ki i Aroer ma tye i dog nota kulu Amon, ki gaŋ ma tye i dye nota-nu, okwako lobo abami ducu ma orabo ŋet Medeba; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kacel ki Kecbon ki gaŋine ducu ma guryeyo wi abami kunnu, Dibon, Bamot-baal, Bet-baalmeon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jakaj, Kedemot, Mepat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiriataim, Cibma, Jeret-cakar ma gigero i wi got ma i dye nota, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Betpeor, pwor got Piciga, ki Bet-jecimot, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "meno aye gaŋi ducu ma gitye i wi abami, ki ker ducu pa Cikon kabaka pa jo Amor ma gaŋ kalle yam tye i Kecbon, ma yam Moses olwenyo kwede oloyo woko, kacel ki ludito pa jo Midian ma gubedo i lobo-nu i te loc pa Cikon; nyiŋgi aye Eyi, Rekem, Jur, Kur ki Reba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaam wod pa Beor bene, ma Latyet, obedo i kin jo ma jo Icrael gunekogi ki pala lucwan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulu Jordan obedo waŋ lobo pa jo Reuben. Meno aye obedo ginaleya pa jo pa Reuben ma oporo wel doggolagi, meno aye gaŋigi ki gaŋi matino ma i ŋetgi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses omiyo ginaleya bot jo pa Gad bene muporo wel doggolagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lobogi obedo Jajer ki gaŋi me lobo Gilead ducu, ki nucu lobo pa jo Ammon o wa i Aroer ma tye i ŋet Raba, yo tuŋ wokceŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cakke ki i Kecbon cito kwede wa i Ramat-mijpe ki Betonim, dok cakke ki i Makanaim cito kwede i waŋ lobo me Lo-debar, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kacel ki Bet-aram, Bet-nimra, Cukot ki Japon, gaŋi ma i nota, en aye lobo mudoŋ ki i kom ker pa Cikon kabaka me Kecbon. Waŋ lobogi obedo kulu Jordan cito kwede wa i but nam me Kineret tuŋ acuc, loka Jordan tuŋ wokceŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meno aye obedo ginaleya pa jo pa Gad muporo wel doggolagi, meno aye gaŋigi ki gaŋi matino ma i ŋetgi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
